{"created": "2026-05-19T05:04:23.029072+00:00", "modified": "2026-05-19T05:04:23.245163+00:00", "id": 20279621, "conceptrecid": "18250103", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20279621", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.18250103", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20279621", "metadata": {"title": "FireBench: 2021 Caldor Benchmarks for Fire Models", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20279621", "publication_date": "2026-05-18", "description": "<p>This collection of benchmarks uses the public resources about the 2021 Caldor Fire.<br>It contains a script based on the FireBench Python library to run over 300 benchmarks related to building damage, burn severity, canopy cover loss, fire perimeters, and weather stations.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It contains observation datasets for:<br>- Building damaged (CALFIRE)<br>- Burn severity (MTBS)<br>- Burn severity (RAVG)<br>- Canopy bottom height (LANDFIRE)<br>- Canopy bulk density (LANDFIRE)<br>- Canopy cover loss (RAVG)<br>- Canopy height (LANDFIRE)<br>- Infrared fire perimeters (NIROPS)<br>- Live basal area change (RAVG)<br>- Weather stations (Synoptic)</p>\n<p>See <a title=\"Caldor Documentation\" href=\"https://firebench.readthedocs.io/en/latest/benchmarks/California/01_Caldor.html\" rel=\"noopener\">FireBench documentation</a> for more information about this dataset and how to run benchmarks with it.</p>\n<p>Licenses for each dataset are contained within the distributed dataset.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Costes, Aur\u00e9lien", "affiliation": "San Jose State University", "orcid": "0000-0003-4543-5107"}, {"name": "Kochanski, Adam", "affiliation": "San Jose State University", "orcid": "0000-0001-7820-2831"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Farguell, Angel", "affiliation": "San Jose State University", "type": "DataCollector", "orcid": "0000-0003-2395-220X"}, {"name": "SELVARAJ, MUTHU KUMARAN", "affiliation": "Worcester Polytechnic Institute", "type": "DataCollector", "orcid": "0000-0003-1286-6744"}], "keywords": ["wildfire", "wildfire modeling", "benchmarking", "model evaluation", "model intercomparison", "fire model"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15477459", "relation": "requires", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}], "dates": [{"type": "created", "description": "Creation date"}, {"type": "updated", "description": "Version 2026.1"}, {"type": "updated", "description": "Version 2026.2"}], "version": "2026.2", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "apache2.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "2113931", "internal_id": "10.13039/100000001::2113931", "funder": {"name": "U.S. National Science Foundation", "doi": "10.13039/100000001", "acronym": "NSF"}, "title": "IUCRC Phase I, San Jose State University: Wildfire Interdisciplinary Research Center (WIRC)", "program": "GEO/OAD"}], "communities": [{"id": "firebench"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "18250103"}}]}}, "title": "FireBench: 2021 Caldor Benchmarks for Fire Models", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20279621", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20279621", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20279621?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20279621", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20279621", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20279621", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20279621/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18250103", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18250103", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18250103", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.18250103", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:20279621/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:20279621/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/